    name: Privacy Not Included (guide)
    summary: The buyer's guide launched in 2017 to explain the privacy risks of connected products; moved to Product Reviews in Nothing Personal on 2026-08-11, its archive left to the Internet Archive.
    owner: O:role/Director-Communications
    confidence: 0.9
