      elicits:
        - {feeling: capability, when: closing a gap in understanding how technology affects a community}
    mattering:
      to-the-whole: The Foundation says it is democratizing tech education globally.
      weight: supporting
      inside:
        - who: ['O:role/VP-Imagination-and-Strategic-Growth']
          because: Teaching with ethics at the core is one of the ways the Foundation invests.
          confidence: 0.5
