        - who: ['M:audience/educators-and-students']
          because: Teachers and researchers get curricula and, for researchers, equitable compute access.
          confidence: 0.5
      prospective:
        - who: ['M:audience/educators-and-students']
          because: Learners curious about how artificial intelligence changes daily life.
          barrier: It is hard to keep up with the latest technology trends, the page says.
          confidence: 0.5

